quri_parts_scaluq/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `quri_parts_scaluq/` directory is a scaluq backend adapter written against the
QURI Parts backend interfaces, following the structure of the QURI Parts qulacs
backend (`quri_parts.qulacs.circuit`, `quri_parts.qulacs.operator`,
`quri_parts.qulacs.estimator`). It carries the Apache License 2.0 header used
throughout QURI Parts and is licensed under Apache-2.0 rather than MIT.

    QURI Parts
