    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    https://github.com/QunaSys/quri-parts

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at
http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 and is reproduced in the header of every
file in that directory.

It is vendored rather than depended upon because no `quri-parts-scaluq` package is
published; the directory was added in commit a1857d1 (2026-03-29).
